---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';
import Hero from '../components/ui/Hero.astro';
import { responsive } from '../lib/responsive';
import { formatDate } from '../lib/format';
import { REGISTERED_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../lib/distributor';

// Set to the date the wording last changed, not the build date.
const LAST_UPDATED = '2026-10-20';

// #78 / review must-have 3 (2026-10-20 draft, pending compliance review). Data flows from
// the owner, S67: bookings in Zoho Bookings; enquiries by WhatsApp or email; CAS through
// the partner distribution platform or by email, never WhatsApp (log decision 117); client records on
// the partner platform and with the RTAs; non-client enquiries deleted after 12 months.
// The old "We do not collect or store personal financial information" was untrue and
// stays removed (COM-004).
const lightLink = 'text-fi-ink hover:text-fi-link font-medium underline';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="What Fund Investigator collects for the website, newsletter, bookings and distribution service, who we share it with, and how long we keep it."
>
  <Hero size="sm" centered={false}>
    <h1 class:list={[responsive.display, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mb-4 leading-tight']}>
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class:list={[responsive.subtitle, 'text-fi-muted']}>
      Last updated: {formatDate(LAST_UPDATED)}
    </p>
  </Hero>

  <Section background="white" spacing="md" maxWidth="md">
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-fi-muted space-y-8">

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <p>
          Fund Investigator is run by {REGISTERED_NAME}. This policy explains what we collect when you read the website, subscribe, book a call or contact us, and when you become a client of our mutual-fund distribution service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mb-6']}>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li><strong>Website use.</strong> Usage data such as pages visited and buttons clicked (see Cookies and Tracking).</li>
          <li><strong>Newsletter.</strong> You subscribe through Substack's form, not a form of ours. Substack provides us with your email address, subscription status and any name associated with your subscription.</li>
          <li><strong>Booking a call.</strong> Our booking page is run by Zoho Bookings. It collects your name, email address, phone number, the time you choose and your answers to the booking questions.</li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp and email.</strong> If you contact us, we receive your name, phone number or email address and what you write.</li>
          <li><strong>If you become a client.</strong> The details needed to serve you and to meet our regulatory obligations: KYC and contact details, your goals, risk profile and other information for the suitability assessment, your existing holdings (for example your Consolidated Account Statement, CAS) and your transaction records.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Clients share their CAS and other financial documents through our partner distribution platform or by email to {CONTACT_EMAIL}. Please do not send financial documents over WhatsApp.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>2. How We Use Information</h2>
        <p>
          We use this information only to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li>Arrange and hold your introductory call, and answer your enquiries</li>
          <li>For clients: carry out fact-finding, risk profiling and the suitability assessment, prepare your shortlist, process the investments you approve and review your portfolio</li>
          <li>Meet our obligations as a mutual-fund distributor, including KYC and record-keeping</li>
          <li>Send subscribers new guides, investigations and updates, and understand newsletter delivery and engagement</li>
          <li>Understand how the website is used, so we can improve it</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>3. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
        <p>
          We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, a privacy-friendly analytics service that does not use cookies or collect personal information. It records anonymous pageviews and basic usage statistics. It does not identify individual users or track behaviour across websites.
        </p>
        <p>
          We also use PostHog, a product analytics service. PostHog uses cookies and records pageviews, clicks and other interactions on fundinvestigator.com and its subdomains, so we can see which pages and buttons lead to a booking, an enquiry or a subscription.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our subscribe page shows Substack's sign-up form, and our booking and WhatsApp buttons open Zoho Bookings and WhatsApp. Each has its own cookies and practices: see <a href="https://substack.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class={lightLink}>Substack's Privacy Policy</a>, <a href="https://www.zoho.com/privacy.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class={lightLink}>Zoho's Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="https://www.whatsapp.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class={lightLink}>WhatsApp's Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>4. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell, trade or rent your information. We share it only with:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li>Service providers that run parts of the service for us: Substack (newsletter), Zoho (bookings), WhatsApp (messages), and PostHog and Cloudflare (website analytics)</li>
          <li>For clients, those needed to process your investments: our partner distribution platform, the registrar and transfer agents (RTAs), the asset management companies and KYC registration agencies</li>
          <li>Regulators and authorities, where the law requires it</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>5. Retention and Your Choices</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li><strong>Enquiries and bookings.</strong> If you do not become a client, we delete your booking details and messages within 12 months of our last contact, or sooner if you ask.</li>
          <li><strong>Client records.</strong> We keep them for as long as SEBI and AMFI record-keeping rules require, then delete them.</li>
          <li><strong>Newsletter.</strong> You can unsubscribe using the link in any newsletter or through Substack. We keep subscriber information only as long as needed to run the publication, honour unsubscribe requests and meet legal obligations.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          You may contact us to ask for access to, correction of or deletion of the information we hold about you. Records the law requires us to keep cannot be deleted before that period ends.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>6. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          We implement reasonable security measures to protect information, and limit access to client records to those who need it to serve you. However, no method of transmission over the internet is completely secure.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>7. Changes to Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>8. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For questions about this Privacy Policy or your information, please contact us at <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`} class="text-fi-ink hover:text-fi-link font-medium">{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </Section>
</Layout>
